    {
      "source": "Ensure that an index for the provided <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a> exists for the collection indicated by the entity\nclass. If not it will be created.",
