      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create the index for the provided <a href=\"IndexDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>IndexDefinition</code></a> for the collection indicated by the entity class. If the\nindex does not exist it will be created. Might error if the collection already defines an index with the same name\nbut different settings.",
